@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv

# Scene2-2-6

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐6
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:29_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『ノアのアトリエ』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗……|#0202Adv06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:来到被诺亚用作画室的房间，<br>碰上了艾玛和汉娜。|#0202Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你们在这里做什么？|#0202Adv06_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们也打算参加蕾雅的舞台剧制作。<br>|#0202Adv06_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是，汉娜就负责当服装师了。<br>|#0202Adv06_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真叫人头疼哇。<br>本小姐怎么就要负责做舞台服了……|#0202Adv06_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管她嘴上抱怨，<br>手里却在熟练地做着针线活。|#0202Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（干活很麻利。看来她很擅长裁缝工作）|#0202Adv06_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么选择来这里干活？|#0202Adv06_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为这里挺宽敞的，比较方便做事。<br>我们也需要足够的空间<br>去摆放材料和制作好的舞台服。|#0202Adv06_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我环视整个房间。|#0202Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知什么时候，房里多了几个油漆桶。<br>|#0202Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:桶里满满都是色彩缤纷的油漆。<br>|#0202Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是诺亚从某处找来，并存放在这里的吧。<br>|#0202Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然整个房间有点脏脏的，<br>但里面有一张大桌子，空间也够宽敞。|#0202Adv06_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（的确，这个房间应该很适合干活）|#0202Adv06_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:剧目已经定好是《小飞侠》了。|#0202Adv06_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛负责饰演温蒂哦！<br>我会做一套精美的舞台服，<br>请好好期待吧！|#0202Adv06_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:好、好的，谢谢。<br>其实我也不知道，现在还在做这种事真的好吗……|#0202Adv06_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这家伙忸怩作态的样子真让人来气……<br>　再聊下去只会让我压力越来越大）|#0202Adv06_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我远离那两人，<br>再次仔细调查房间里的情况。|#0202Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:画室里只能透进微弱的光，<br>而且每次来都是乱糟糟的样子。|#0202Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:石膏像上有着细小的裂纹，<br>工作桌上密布着各种工具刻下的痕迹。|#0202Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还摆放着许多没有画完的油画，<br>但并不是诺亚的手笔。|#0202Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（看来有必要彻底打扫一次）|#0202Adv06_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，地上散乱的画纸上的内容变了。<br>看来，至少还是会定期扔进垃圾桶的。|#0202Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从阳台俯瞰中庭，<br>正下方就是高耸的尖锐铁栅栏。|#0202Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 室内を走る足音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_126 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，汉娜！<br>让你们久等啦！|#0202Adv06_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:随着一阵吵闹的脚步声，<br>雪莉跑进了画室，我也回过头来。|#0202Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@EmoteJump ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:给，收着吧！我已经把所有能找到的绿色布料<br>全都拿过来了！|#0202Adv06_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 衣ずれの音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_41 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉把怀里满满一摞绿色布料<br>放在工作桌上。|#0202Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你好厉害啊。居然能找到这么多，<br>都是在哪里找到的？|#0202Adv06_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:我把各个房间里的<br>窗帘和桌布什么的全都扯下来了！<br>|#0202Adv06_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是在干什么！？<br>未免也太离谱了吧！<br>而且，根本用不到这么多呀！|#0202Adv06_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见汉娜大发脾气，<br>雪莉便把窗帘摊开给她看。|#0202Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你有没有在网红影片里<br>看过这种东西！？|#0202Adv06_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么意思……？|#0202Adv06_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:绿幕呀！<br>用来抠掉背景合成影片的那个东西！|#0202Adv06_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～……在天气预报里见到过。|#0202Adv06_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定我们不光要演舞台剧，<br>还会拍电影什么的呢。|#0202Adv06_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，你就为了这个把窗帘和桌布都扯下来，<br>真令人不敢置信……|#0202Adv06_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜盯着窗帘撕破的地方紧蹙眉头。<br>|#0202Adv06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:再不爱惜东西，可是会遭报应的。<br>我们现在已经每天都在浪费东西了。|#0202Adv06_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:听到汉娜的话，艾玛和雪莉都十分不解。|#0202Adv06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:就是我们穿的衣服呀！|#0202Adv06_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在监牢里，外衣自不必说，<br>就连换洗内衣裤都是监牢提供的。|#0202Adv06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据规定，当天穿过的衣服和内衣<br>都必须丢进淋浴房的垃圾滑槽里。<br>我也一直遵守这个规定，每天都会丢弃。|#0202Adv06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每天都丢掉衣服，实在是太浪费了！|#0202Adv06_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:之前我问了典狱长，<br>听说那个垃圾滑槽，好像是通向地下的焚烧炉来着。<br>|#0202Adv06_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:居然都烧掉了！？<br>明明洗一洗还能继续穿呢！|#0202Adv06_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，它们对【魔女】已经忌讳到了要烧掉衣服的程度吧～|#0202Adv06_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们哪里有那么脏哇～！！|#0202Adv06_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:变成【魔女】以后可就不好说了哦？|#0202Adv06_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定还会散发出一些<br>不明致病细菌什么的……|#0202Adv06_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那……那就到时候再说嘛！|#0202Adv06_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:至少我们现在还不是魔女……<br>这样实在是太浪费了……|#0202Adv06_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不想浪费的话，不丢掉大概也行吧。<br>感觉它们也没有检查得那么仔细。|#0202Adv06_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你说得对。<br>以后我就自己洗衣服了！|#0202Adv06_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，要是违规行为被发现了，<br>搞不好会受处分哦？|#0202Adv06_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唔唔……|#0202Adv06_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（这两个人真的好吵……）|#0202Adv06_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再加上艾玛也在场，怎么也集中不了精神。<br>我只好放弃调查，离开了画室。|#0202Adv06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

